  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Conjuration; <strong>CL</strong> 9th; <strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 10,330 gp, <strong>Weight</strong> 10 lbs.</p>\n<p>This +1 ghost touch snag net may be used to entangle ethereal and incorporeal creatures. A creature so entangled cannot pass through solid matter until it is freed. While entangled in the net, such a creature is subject to trip and grapple attempts.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Magic Arms and Armor, plane shift or Conjuration sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 5,320 gp</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-magic-items#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
